Third-party software
--------------------

This repository also contains software written by others, each under its own
terms, given in full in the files themselves:

  cJSON.c, cJSON.h               cJSON, by Dave Gamble and cJSON contributors
                                 (MIT license)
  sqlite-amalgamation-3420000/   SQLite 3.42.0 (public domain)
  qd/                            the QD double-double library, from Lawrence
                                 Berkeley National Laboratory
  md5.c                          the RSA Data Security, Inc. MD5 Message-Digest
                                 Algorithm
  sha3.c, sha3.h                 SHA-3, by Markku-Juhani O. Saarinen
  gwnum/fftsg.c                  derived from Takuya Ooura's FFT package
  gwnum/giants.c, giants.h       derived from the giants library,
                                 copyright 1997-1998 Perfectly Scientific, Inc.

Prime95 also contains distributed computing software licensed from
Entropia.com, Inc.

The official releases link against GMP (https://gmplib.org, LGPL), hwloc
(https://www.open-mpi.org/projects/hwloc/, BSD license), libcurl
(https://curl.se, curl license), and all builds use the Boost headers
(https://www.boost.org, Boost Software License).
